        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion A3-0 Sandcast Bronze Small Scalloped Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion Hardware's Scalloped deadbolt has an old world feel that is a beautiful as it is versatile since it will look great on period style homes as well as more modern houses. It is available as either single cylinder or double cylinder; and both meet ANSI 156.5 grade 2 criteria. Available in antique bronze, dark bronze and medium bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion A3 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>True Bronze Product (Sandcast and Lost Wax) with over 90% Copper Content</li>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for River Rock Collection Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder</b> -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder</b> - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Small Scalloped Sandcast Bronze Deadbolt, Fusion A3",
                "description": "Scalloped Deadbolt Fusion A3 - Fusion Hardware's Scalloped deadbolt has an old world feel that is a beautiful as it is versatile since it will look great on period style homes as well as more modern houses. It is available as either single cylinder or double cylinder; and both meet ANSI 156.5 grade 2 criteria. Available in antique bronze, dark bronze and medium bronze finishes.",
